# MANDIBLES: the red queens lay mostly workers (a soldier in three at most)
# and about one new worker in six walks over to look at your queen first.
game mandibles
wait 5
cheat mission 6 26
cheat clear
cheat store 0
cheat red_store 30
cheat at 40 120
wait 1500
expect red_workers >= 18
expect red_soldiers <= 11
expect red_scouts >= 1
